      "writtenOn": "2022-10-06T00:01:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh dang, this seems like a super obvious problem now.\n\nIdentity creds needs the same key upgrade support, I think. So we\u0027re already at two HALs that need this. Therefore, we should have a general solution for upgrading blobs that are stored in rkpd.\n\nMy inclination is that we go back to having the client of rkpd handle doing the upgrade, then notify rkpd of the upgraded blob. First I want to  page-in the thought process that led us to this design in the first place. I vaguely recall Very Good Reasons™ for doing this, but not exactly what those reasons are.",
